[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Knock, Knock!]
[00:00.76]Lesson 115 | 第115课
[00:03.62]Knock, knock! | 敲敲门！
[00:06.33]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.12]What does Jim have to drink? | 吉姆喝什么？
[00:16.93]Isn't there anyone at home? | 家里没人吗？
[00:21.04]I'll knock again, Helen. | 海伦，我再敲一次。
[00:24.25]Everything's very quiet. | 一切都很安静。
[00:26.97]I'm sure there's no one at home. | 我确信家里没人。
[00:30.52]But that's impossible. | 但那不可能。
[00:33.04]Carol and Tom invited us to lunch. | 卡罗尔和汤姆邀请我们吃午饭。
[00:37.48]Look through the window. | 看看窗户。
[00:40.14]Can you see anything? | 你能看到什么吗？
[00:43.12]Nothing at all. | 什么都没有。
[00:45.61]Let's try the back door. | 我们试试后门吧。
[00:48.75]Look! Everyone's in the garden. | 看！大家都在花园里。
[00:52.98]Hello, Helen. Hello, Jim. | 你好，海伦。你好，吉姆。
[00:56.99]Everybody wants to have lunch in the garden. | 大家都想在花园里吃午饭。
[01:01.36]It's nice and warm out here. | 这里又好又暖和。
[01:04.44]Come and have something to drink. | 来喝点什么吧。
[01:08.21]Thanks, Carol. | 谢谢，卡罗尔。
[01:10.54]May I have a glass of beer please? | 请给我一杯啤酒好吗？
[01:14.30]Beer? | 啤酒？
[01:15.47]There's none left. | 没剩下了。
[01:17.53]You can have some lemonade. | 你可以喝些柠檬水。
[01:20.66]Lemonade! | 柠檬水！
[01:22.48]Don't believe her, Jim. | 别信她，吉姆。
[01:24.63]She's only joking. | 她只是开玩笑。
[01:26.26]Have some beer! | 喝点啤酒！